{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026brx3ATmVtC1795412952.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗山水盈本月錄得1宗成交，為5座高層A室，實用面積936平方呎，三房套房間隔，叫價980萬元，議價後以938萬元沽出，實用呎價10,021元。</p><p><br/>王勤學表示，原業主於2019年11月以1076.6萬元一手買入單位，持貨約7年，賬面蝕138.6萬元，單位貶值12.9%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:03:29.936255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.750799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:56:54.587546+00:00","content_hash":"a76f564a61638aede70fb4ce012a973dd74b7e77c5ff70cf00d59b6d6083ca6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:03:29.936255+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}